 "faq": [
  [
   "When can I play?",
   "Chapter 1 is playable in testing now. A Google Play release is planned - follow along here for news. Chapters 2 to 5 are in development."
  ],
  [
   "Which devices does it run on?",
   "Android first, built in Unity for phones and tablets in landscape. It is also tested on PC."
  ],
  [
   "Does it need an internet connection?",
   "No. The game plays fully offline. The only feature that goes online is entering a redeem code, which is checked on our server."
  ],
  [
   "Are there ads or in-app purchases?",
   "Not in the current build. If that ever changes we will say so here and update the Privacy Policy before the update ships."
  ],
  [
   "Is there multiplayer?",
   "Local PVP: two players on one device (Split Screen Duel, Score Race or Last Fish Standing). There is no online play and no account."
  ],
  [
   "What data do you collect?",
   "None about you. Progress and settings stay on your device. Entering a redeem code sends the code and a random device ID so it can only be used the allowed number of times - read the full Privacy Policy for details."
  ],
  [
   "How do I get in touch?",
   "Email nazeehfazal12@gmail.com - bug reports, ideas and fish suggestions are all welcome."
  ]
 ]
